# Source-authored airborne Square/X target-special.  Jump states route a punch
# against an airborne target through predicate 109 to state 86 rather than the
# ordinary state-81 aerial punch chain.
# The state-86 input window is narrower than one 50 ms authored animation
# frame: 100 ms is still below the strict height gate in this setup, while
# 150 ms lets the falling target pass beneath the fixed entry-time pursuit
# vector. A 25 ms physics step preserves the native-valid 125 ms sample.
fixed_step_ms 25
sample_interval_ms 25
capture_interval_ms 0
max_time_ms 75000
start_time_ms 53033
render_size 1280 720

wait_gameplay 60000
teleport 14172 -7978 7 -0.416 -0.909 0
move_until_cinematic 14067 -8205 7 71 10000
wait_enemies_active 5000 394 395 397
set_enemy_ai 394 0
set_enemy_ai 395 0
set_enemy_ai 397 0
set_enemy_physics 394 1

# Remove only the two competing helper targets so production acquisition must
# select the launched knife thug.  The tested victim retains authored health.
damage_enemy 395 100000
damage_enemy 397 100000
# Approach object 394 from its authored front. CBehaviorHurt::BehaviorStart
# routes a front hit-type-121 launch to airborne state 53; hitting from behind
# instead selects non-air helper state 52 even though the force still lifts it.
teleport 13454 -6591 7 -0.454 0.891 0

punch
jump_release_attack_when_ready 1000
move_until_state 1000 0 0 97
wait 350
assert_enemy_health_near 394 405 0.01
move_until_state 1500 0 0 0

# A fresh jump plus Square/X sees the airborne target and enters the 50-damage
# diagonal kick. Effect 16 is its authored strike trail; effect 26 belongs to
# the later state-116 web whirlwind and must not be attributed to this move.
jump
# State 13's authored input gate is open here, but state 86 additionally
# requires Spider-Man's Unit base to be strictly more than 40 cm above the
# launched target (Player::SetNextStateId, 0x0034ab50-0x0034ab82). Advance the
# jump to that native-valid geometry before pressing Square/X.
wait 125
punch
move_until_state 500 0 0 86
assert_player_state 86
wait 80
assert_player_effect 16 1
assert_enemy_health_near 394 355 0.01
assert_audio_played SFX_AIR_DIAGONAL_KICK
assert_audio_played SFX_KICK_IMPACT_1
# Accepted contact latches the state exactly once even while the dash and
# whirlwind trail continue through their authored follow-through.
wait 500
assert_enemy_health_near 394 355 0.01
assert_health_above 0
finish
